  "prefLabel": "Lot 1104.07 Prizes",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 1104.07 Prizes.\n\n(a) In accordance with RSA 284:48, II, the licensee shall pay all prizes of greater than $500 by check, on a single wager. The licensee shall not cash checks which it issues.\n\n(b) All prizes shall be paid in full, less required tax withholdings, at the time the claim is made and after the ticket is properly validated.\n\nSource. #12412, eff 10-27-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot1100.html"
